# Web3Forms access key used by the Contacto and PQRSD forms.
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com/ (no account required to start).
# This is a public-facing key by design (Web3Forms validates submissions
# server-side and can be domain-restricted in their dashboard) — it is safe
# to expose in the client bundle, which is why it's prefixed PUBLIC_.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
